00:11:26.001 --> 00:11:27.163
I believe in you.

00:11:27.163 --> 00:11:28.987
I hope you continue to believe in yourself

00:11:28.987 --> 00:11:31.220
and whatever your one word is.

00:11:31.220 --> 00:11:35.387
Much love, have an amazing
day and I'll see you soon.

00:11:41.544 --> 00:11:45.106
- So when you talk about
making your dash dance.

00:11:45.106 --> 00:11:49.106
Point one, you got to be
willing to do it afraid.

00:11:51.130 --> 00:11:53.534
See you might be waiting
for the fear to stop,

00:11:53.534 --> 00:11:55.153
"Lisa, I heard this so many times.

00:11:55.153 --> 00:11:57.222
"Lisa, I'm afraid, what do I do?"

00:11:57.222 --> 00:11:58.305
Do it anyway.

00:11:59.520 --> 00:12:02.426
"Lisa, I'm afraid I don't
quite know if I should move."

00:12:02.426 --> 00:12:03.426
Move anyway.

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:06.270
"I don't know if I should leap."

00:12:06.270 --> 00:12:07.270
Leap afraid.

00:12:10.046 --> 00:12:14.137
And then gather your
courage on the way down.

00:12:14.137 --> 00:12:15.861
And if you don't get it before you hit,

00:12:15.861 --> 00:12:17.936
you was going to hit anyway.

00:12:17.936 --> 00:12:22.074
I'd rather die leaping than
on the edge figuring out how

00:12:22.074 --> 00:12:23.162
to get the courage to leap.

00:12:23.162 --> 00:12:23.995
Yes, yes?

00:12:23.995 --> 00:12:24.866
- [Audience] Yes, yes.

00:12:24.866 --> 00:12:25.699
- Yes, yes?

00:12:25.699 --> 00:12:26.734
- [Audience] Yes, yes.

00:12:26.734 --> 00:12:28.266
- So many times, we're waiting.

00:12:28.266 --> 00:12:30.120
We're waiting, I'm waiting.

00:12:30.120 --> 00:12:31.673
I'm waiting to get something right.

00:12:31.673 --> 00:12:33.471
I see your hands going up, you guys know.

00:12:33.471 --> 00:12:34.924
If it's your truth,
you can raise your hand

00:12:34.924 --> 00:12:36.510
just like we did on day zero.

00:12:36.510 --> 00:12:37.685
You're just kind of waiting.

00:12:37.685 --> 00:12:39.550
You're waiting to get everything in order.

00:12:39.550 --> 00:12:42.118
You're waiting, you're
waiting so that everything

00:12:42.118 --> 00:12:44.122
that's in you is together.

00:12:44.122 --> 00:12:45.718
You're waiting to not be afraid.

00:12:45.718 --> 00:12:47.809
You're waiting to have the courage.

00:12:47.809 --> 00:12:49.508
You're waiting to have all the money.

00:12:49.508 --> 00:12:52.008
You're waiting to lose weight.

00:12:53.499 --> 00:12:57.530
See, if I waited to
release my unwanted pounds

00:12:57.530 --> 00:12:59.006
before I got in front of you,

00:12:59.006 --> 00:13:02.292
Lisa Nichols would be the secret.

00:13:02.292 --> 00:13:04.571
(laughter)

00:13:04.571 --> 00:13:05.404
Yes, yes?

00:13:05.404 --> 00:13:06.315
- [Audience] Yes, yes.

00:13:06.315 --> 00:13:10.293
- I thought, how about I just
leap with my imperfection

00:13:10.293 --> 00:13:14.673
and then find my form of
perfecting my imperfection

00:13:14.673 --> 00:13:16.416
while I'm soaring?

00:13:16.416 --> 00:13:18.281
How about I do that?

00:13:18.281 --> 00:13:21.043
How about you not wait to get it right?

00:13:21.043 --> 00:13:24.235
You figure out how does
it look doing it wrong.

00:13:24.235 --> 00:13:25.854
How does that look?

00:13:25.854 --> 00:13:30.034
Because your 80% of right
is somebody else's 159%

00:13:30.034 --> 00:13:31.722
of what they needed.

00:13:31.722 --> 00:13:32.555
Yes, yes?

00:13:32.555 --> 00:13:33.388
- [Audience] Yes, yes.

00:13:33.388 --> 00:13:34.315
- And when you want to do it right,

00:13:34.315 --> 00:13:35.621
and you want to wait
'til you're not afraid,

00:13:35.621 --> 00:13:37.029
and you want to wait 'til
you have it all together,

00:13:37.029 --> 00:13:39.340
oh, you made it about you.

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:40.173
Again.

00:13:41.333 --> 00:13:42.885
See, Nelson Mandela did it.

00:13:42.885 --> 00:13:44.663
He just did it not
knowing if it were right.

00:13:44.663 --> 00:13:47.626
Mahatma Gandhi just did it
not knowing if it were right.

00:13:47.626 --> 00:13:50.307
Mother Teresa just did it
not looking for affirmation

00:13:50.307 --> 00:13:53.039
or confirmation, is this right?

00:13:53.039 --> 00:13:55.023
Martin Luther King did it not even knowing

00:13:55.023 --> 00:13:58.505
if it would happen before his life ended.

00:13:58.505 --> 00:14:00.633
I mean, what are you waiting on?

00:14:00.633 --> 00:14:03.190
Are you willing to do it afraid?

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:06.309
Are you willing to do it knowing
that you got so much work

00:14:06.309 --> 00:14:08.947
to do to get it better,
to get it more perfect,

00:14:08.947 --> 00:14:11.214
but are you willing to do
it inside your imperfection?

00:14:11.214 --> 00:14:12.778
Do you realize that in your imperfection,

00:14:12.778 --> 00:14:14.720
you're perfect for the job?

00:14:14.720 --> 00:14:16.032
- Who did you become?

00:14:16.032 --> 00:14:19.319
I mean, did you use your days as platforms

00:14:19.319 --> 00:14:21.152
for further greatness?

00:14:22.036 --> 00:14:25.686
Did you use your days to transcend fear

00:14:25.686 --> 00:14:27.497
towards fearlessness?

00:14:27.497 --> 00:14:30.282
Did you use your days,
even the hard times,

00:14:30.282 --> 00:14:34.248
so that you leveraged
suffering into wisdom?

00:14:34.248 --> 00:14:36.907
Did you use the moments of your life

00:14:36.907 --> 00:14:41.780
to develop wisdom, compassion,
to become more creative,

00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:43.098
to release potential?

00:14:43.098 --> 00:14:44.238
Who did you become?

00:14:44.238 --> 00:14:47.950
That's really the first
purpose of life, I believe.

